  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/923005/description_4c3a4c2a-2d22-4ddb-8418-2086f7fd6028.png\"></p>\n<p><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/KCEC7ZtYfC\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1097855564391911580?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label= &labelColor=8a6240&color=f5deb3\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/temporal-api/files/5462687\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/923005/description_be8a170d-0a8e-4e93-80b9-28071b89cb8e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Extra Compat</strong> 通过添加缺失内容、将大量物品加入标签、填补空白、修正命名错误、向 Java 类中补充缺失条目等方式，为众多热门模组提供更好的兼容支持与修复！</p>\n<hr>\n<p>常见问题：</p>\n<p><strong>会有 Fabric 版本吗？：</strong></p>\n<p>不会。</p>\n<p><strong>会添加更多模组的兼容支持吗？：</strong></p>\n<p>会的。我会持续更新此模组并添加更多兼容内容，如果您有任何建议，欢迎在评论区留言。</p>\n<p><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用它吗？：</strong></p>\n<p>可以，欢迎在任意 CurseForge 整合包中使用。</p>\n<p><strong>受影响的模组完整列表请参见 README：</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/CyberRat7/Extra_Compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/CyberRat7/Extra_Compat</a></p>\n<p><strong>Modrinth 页面：</strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fextracompat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/extracompat</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fTemporal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/0bc7f482-442a-49d8-a275-988d007d626c.webp\"></a></p>",
